    <sys:String x:Key="Rec.NoCapture">This version of Windows cannot capture windows. Update to Windows 10 version 1903 or later.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Rec.NoGpu">No hardware graphics card was found, so capture runs on the software renderer and will be slow. Install your graphics driver.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Rec.IntegratedGpu">Integrated graphics: your game and VIZEN share the same GPU. If a game keeps the GPU near 100%, overlays may drop frames; allow Auto Performance to lower them to 30 fps, or lower the game's graphics settings.</sys:String>
