    <sys:String x:Key="Draw.Subtitle">Draw arrows, shapes, freehand lines and text directly over your desktop, browsers, apps, VIZEN overlays and borderless games. In pass-through mode, your drawings stay on screen while every click goes to whatever is underneath.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Draw.EnableTitle">Smart Draw</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Draw.EnableDescription">On: a drawing surface covers each monitor (the taskbar stays free) and a small toolbar appears. Off: no part of Smart Draw is running.</sys:String>
